    <section class="hero">
      <h1>A sandbox for<br><em>small, useful things.</em></h1>
      <p>NerveSocket is where I keep my nerdy experiments, mostly PHP and SQLite, and the tools that grew out of them. Poke around.</p>
      <p><a class="btn" href="#projects">See what's here</a></p>
    </section>

    <section id="projects">
      <h2>Projects</h2>
      <div class="grid">
                  <a class="card" href="/wall/">
            <h3>Social Wall</h3>
            <p>A stream of social posts.</p>
          </a>
                  <a class="card" href="/rsvp/">
            <h3>RSVP</h3>
            <p>Make an event, collect replies.</p>
          </a>
                  <a class="card" href="/yt/">
            <h3>YT DL</h3>
            <p>Grab video for offline use.</p>
          </a>
                  <a class="card" href="/paste/">
            <h3>Paste Bin</h3>
            <p>Quick text and code snippets.</p>
          </a>
                  <a class="card" href="https://hashex.ca/">
            <h3>HashEx</h3>
            <p>Hashtag Exchange game.</p>
          </a>
                  <a class="card" href="/mastodontags/">
            <h3>Mastodon Tags</h3>
            <p>Hashtag relationships in the fediverse.</p>
          </a>
                  <a class="card" href="https://img.nervesocket.com/">
            <h3>Image Hosting</h3>
            <p>Drop an image, get a link.</p>
          </a>
                  <a class="card" href="https://loothunt.ca/">
            <h3>LootHunt</h3>
            <p>Organize a treasure hunt.</p>
          </a>
              </div>
    </section>

